SUMMARY:Halloween Dance & Speaker Meeting
DESCRIPTION:SCIF presents a night of Halloween fun in sobriety! Come join us for a Halloween Dance & Speaker Meeting featuring a guest speaker\, dancing\, music\, treats\, and plenty of fellowship.\n\n\n\n\n\n🎃 Costumes encouraged! Prizes will be awarded for the three best costumes.\n\n\n\n\n\n📅 Saturday\, October 31\n🕐 5:00–10:30 PM\n📍 The Saturday Afternoon Club\n430 10th St.\nSanta Rosa\, CA\n\n\n\n\nWhat’s Happening?\n\n\n\n\n 	Guest speaker at 6:30 PM\n 	Dance & music\n 	Halloween treats\n 	Costume contest with prizes for the top three costumes\n\n\n\n\n\n💵 $20 suggested donation\n\n\n\n\n\nCome celebrate Halloween\, enjoy some spooky-season fun\, and experience Having Fun in Sobriety!
URL:https://sonomacountyaa.org/event/halloween-dance-speaker-meeting/
LOCATION:Saturday Afternoon Club\, 420 10th St.\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95401\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sonomacountyaa.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/halloween-26-tabloid.png
